~ Q1
if Q1.claimed:
	if Q1.Qcompleted:
		if Q1.q1_ended == false:
			Sam: Wow here is you 10 coins!
			set Global.Coin += 10
			set Q1.q1_ended = true
			set Global.Q_state = 2
			=> END
	else:
		Sam: Come back then the quest is finished!
		=> END
else:
	Sam: Hello there!
	You: Do you have a quest for me?
	Sam: Yes I do if you kill a red enemy I will give you 10 coins.
	- Start quest
		Sam: Well you better get the job done!
		set Q1.claimed = true
		=> END
	- Leave => END
~ Q2
if Q2.claimed:
	if Q2.Qcompleted:
		if Q2.q2_ended == false:
			Sam: Wow here is you 50 coins!
			set Global.Coin += 50
			set Q2.q2_ended = true
			set Global.Q_state = 3
			=> END
	else:
		Sam: Come back then the quest is finished!
		=> END
else:
	Sam: Didn't expect you to come back. Do you want a nother quest?
	- What is the quest?
		Sam: Kill 3 red enemys for 50 coins.
		- Yes
			Sam: Well you better get the job done!
			set Q2.claimed = true
			=> END
		- No => END
	- No! => END
	=> END